This package does not read Code OSS, Sandy, GitHub CLI, or other applications'
credential caches. Each sign-in obtains its own user-authorized credential.
The public client identifier can be overridden for another GitHub OAuth app
with device flow enabled; it is not an OpenCode Lab-owned app registration.
